# Migrations are append-only. internal/store.migrate tracks progress as the
# index into the sorted file list (PRAGMA user_version), so a migration that a
# database has already applied may never be inserted before, renamed, deleted
# or edited. TestMigrationsAreAppendOnly in migrations_internal_test.go fails
# when one is.
#
# Append one line per new migration - never regenerate this file to make the
# test pass. The line is what `cd migrations && shasum -a 256 <name>.sql`
# prints (`sha256sum` on Linux): the sha256, two spaces, the bare file name.
